ce:CE23-3-falsifier a sj:Falsifier ;
    rdfs:label "CE23-3 falsifier" ;
    dcterms:description "The CE23-3 court exits 0 on a STOP-GC-26.9.23 receipt that is not fresh, says STOP=false, lacks an admitted gate receipt, or fails replay; the recorded gap is the counterexample: 11/13 observed; pushed STOP receipt stale (chatman-ce23.md)." .

